{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:224bf8ca0667b688","name":"Massassi General Template","source":{"id":"source:reference-224bf8ca0667b688","title":"Massassi General Template","revision":19246,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:35:32Z","sha256":"abad0a8d49bca8798df9b0ecb64aa1aa67e35f88c4602ba54c4e99cc95404328","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19246","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Massassi%20General%20Template&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-224bf8ca0667b688","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10% or 1,000 credits (whichever is higher) more than the base item\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Applicable To:"]}," Armor; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Built by primitive creatures for use in the service of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},", Massassi items are designed to take advantage of the strength of their wielders.  \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapons:"]}," When a character scores a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," with a Massassi Weapon held in two hands, that character triples their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus to damage (before multiplying for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},"). However, if a character does not have a sufficient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score (15 for Medium Weapons, 17 for Large Weapons, or 19 for Huge and bigger weapons) then they take a -2 penalty to attack rolls with that weapon, even if proficient.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armors:"]}," Massassi Armor allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," against the wearer to be turned into a normal hit once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". However, if a character does not have a sufficient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score (13 for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"},", 15 for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medium Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medium_Armor","referenceId":"reference:e2a45d7d144d40dd"},", or 17 for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},") they take ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Check Penalties"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalties"}," even when proficient in the Armor.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
